  "title": "Core behavioral block library",
  "description": "Reviewed technology-free behavioral blocks for functional circuit reconstruction: switching, amplification, sampling, quantization and timing cells with closed contracts, ngspice-native implementations behind stable bhv_<block>_v<abi> wrappers, Verilog-A sources compiled through the reviewed OSDI path where continuous, and event-cell Verilog-A references for contracts whose sampled semantics the OSDI path cannot honor.",
